\(C \mathrm{Eq}\) is
<br/> \(|A-\lambda I|=0\)<br/>
or \(\lambda^{2}-2 \lambda+(1-2 K)=0\)
<br/> \(\lambda=1 \pm \sqrt{2 K}\)<br/>
E vector for \(\lambda=1 \pm \sqrt{2 K}\) :
<br/> \(A X=\lambda X\)<br/>
<br/> \[\begin{aligned}
(A-\lambda I) X &amp; =0 \\
{\left[\begin{array}{cc}
-\sqrt{2 K} &amp; K \\
2 &amp; -\sqrt{2 K}
\end{array}\right]\left[\begin{array}{l}
x_{1} \\
x_{2}
\end{array}\right] } &amp; =\left[\begin{array}{l}
0 \\
0
\end{array}\right] \\
\Rightarrow \quad-\sqrt{2 K} x_{1}+K x_{2} &amp; =0
\end{aligned}\]<br/>
or
<br/> \[\begin{aligned}
&amp; x_{1}=\sqrt{\frac{K}{2}} x_{2} \\
&amp; X=\left[\begin{array}{l}
x_{1} \\
x_{2}
\end{array}\right]=\left[\begin{array}{c}
\sqrt{K / 2} \\
1
\end{array}\right] \approx\left[\begin{array}{c}
1 \\
\sqrt{\frac{2}{K}}
\end{array}\right]
\end{aligned}\]<br/>
Similarly other \(E\) vector is
<br/> \[X=\left[\begin{array}{c}
-\sqrt{\frac{K}{2}} \\
1
\end{array}\right]=\left[\begin{array}{c}
1 \\
-\sqrt{\frac{2}{K}}
\end{array}\right]\]
